{"seed":9984,"ability":"scarecrow","action":"stage_injury","context":"explore","position":"A","target":null,"dayTicksBefore":497,"dayPartBefore":3,"grantOk":true,"grantMethod":"abilities-push","openingKcal":47250,"result":true,"resultError":null,"sayLines":["\"Hey.\" A woman, maybe 20s, with a farmer's tan settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\" (Talk to A woman, maybe 20s, with a farmer's tan.)","Recipe: Bark armor (Level 1). You have seen bark armor. Plates of bark laced together, worn like a shell.","🛡️ Dawn at Haven. By the fire hangs an old bark cuirass, split at the seam — somebody's grandfather wore this into the treeline and came back. The shape of it is clear: bark plates laced overlapping like shingles, vine cord. Your hands don't know it yet. Your eyes do.","Overnight the bank burns −505 kcal. Feast again, or spend it.","Village meal: +400 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)","A person, maybe 50s is showing A man, maybe 40s, with a crooked nose how to tie a snare. Hands patient. It takes three tries.","A person, maybe 50s is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 77/100)","🔍 A crouches over a shrub with glossy leaflets that smell of curry when crushed, studying it a moment before moving on. (1/3 looks)","A man, maybe 30s came back with 565 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes.","Otto and Ernestine lingered over the fire together.","David and Alessia lingered over the fire together.","📓 Journal: the person in their 60s, with a slouched posture taught the man in his 40s, with a crooked nose Soft Step.","📓 Journal: the woman in her 20s, with tattooed arms taught the man in his 40s, with sun-creased eyes Diplomatic Incident.","— DAY 2 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","👀 the person in their 50s, the piano tuner starts a story with \"back when I was a piano tuner...\" then corrects to something else